+    """Schwartz 2025 Eq. 1 mode fractions from deuteron/triton spin fractions.
+
+    The spin-polarized D-T collision splits into three angular modes with
+    fractions (a, b, c). Given the deuteron spin-projection fractions
+    (d_plus, d_zero, d_minus) and triton fractions (t_plus, t_minus) -- each set
+    summing to 1 -- the mode fractions are
+
+        a = d_plus*t_plus + d_minus*t_minus     (the (3/4)sin²θ shape)
+        b = d_zero                              (transverse deuteron, m=0)
+        c = d_plus*t_minus + d_minus*t_plus     (shares the B-mode shape)
